But he's holding that.

1279
00:52:33.500 --> 00:52:35.200
She's like, I'm happy with my choices.

1280
00:52:35.660 --> 00:52:37.300
He's holding that mirror up.

1281
00:52:37.380 --> 00:52:38.660
That's what he does to her.

1282
00:52:38.660 --> 00:52:40.940
Yeah, I know.

